...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
registry: 트러스트 레지스트리 { class: store }
audit: 감사 로그 { class: store }

user -> ui: 주제 입력 + 실행 버튼 클릭(임계값 30, Writer=Untrusted Bot)
ui -> registry: verify(agent_id="researcher-001", min_score=30)
registry -> ui: TrustVerdict(agent=researcher-001, trusted=True)
ui -> audit: record(trust_verification)
ui -> registry: verify(agent_id="analyst-001", min_score=30)
registry -> ui: TrustVerdict(agent=analyst-001, trusted=True)
ui -> audit: record(trust_verification)
ui -> registry: verify(agent_id="rogue-bot-99", min_score=30)
registry -> ui: TrustVerdict(agent=rogue-bot-99, trusted=False)
ui -> audit: record(trust_verification)
